    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA 5 Bed detached property in a secluded and much sought after town centre location. No 4 Saint Mary's Villas located on the south side of Drogheda, just off Dublin Road and within a 3-minute walk of Drogheda's Mac Bride train station. Very rarely do property arise in this mature and small development which is sure to appeal to a wide variety of discerning purchasers. The property has a downstairs ensuite bedroom and enjoys a secure and private rear garden with a south facing aspect and fabulous, mature apple trees. \nA superb range of amenities are within easy walking distance, including primary and secondary schools, shops, cafés, bars and restaurants. Drogheda Train Station is less than 500 metres away and the centre of town is approximately 800 metres from the property. The nearby R132 provides swift access to the M1 Motorway, placing Dublin Airport and the M50 both within an approximately 35-minute drive.\nViewing is strictly by appointment with sole selling agents, Sherry FitzGerald Lannon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.93 x 3.28\n\n\nHall - 3.37 x 3.28\n\n\nSitting Room - 3.53 x 5.68\n\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.81 x 4.91\n\n\nFamily Room - 3.37 x 3.40\n\n\nWC - 1.86 x 1.80\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.89 x 2.71\n\n\nEnsuite - 1.51 x 2.71\n\n\nConservatory - 2.92 x 4.90\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.53 x 5.68\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.37 x 4.59\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.67 x 3.89\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.47 x 2.71\n\n\nBathroom - 2.68 x 1.97\n\n\nTOTAL: - Approx. 170 SqM/1,830 SqFt\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil central heating</li><li>Secluded development</li><li>Private site</li><li>3 minute walk to train station</li><li>2 minute walk to bus stop</li><li>Close to choice of schools</li><li>All amenities within short walking distance</li><li>15 minute walk to Drogheda town centre</li><li>Easy immediate access to R132</li><li>35 minute drive to Dublin Airport/M50</ul>"
